# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Alliance, part 3 of 4 (2026-11-12). Hand-written from players'
# recordings of the zone and Forever's quest data for titles, levels, objectives and places.
# Order: from Powderfuse Port, the Eastsea pirates' second wave (levels 43-45) and Captain Bentcoin's camp; the port;
# the pirates' ships and Admiral Lamora on the north-eastern cliffs; Argo's mushrooms on the ridge west of them;
# Dunston Willis in Bolder'ok; south to the port again; the wildflowers west of it; Farholde Keep, where Sunnyglade's
# and the port's errands are handed in.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings): Smuggler's Bargain after Smuggler's Special;
# See Ya, Scallywags! and Admiral Lamora after the second wave's first two; The Monster Surfaces after It Takes Guts;
# Dunston Checks Out after In Need of Relief; The Western Front and A Small Favor after Ashe Amberhall's two
# Sunnyglade quests; Out in the Field after Saving Sunnyglade; Saving Marshal Ryan after Field Marshal's Log;
# Brother Lowley's next jobs after Wound Dressings.
# Left out on purpose:
# - Shipping and Handling (95296) and I Know a Guy (95295): Friz's errands end in Tanaris and Booty Bay, and the
#   second one sends you back here.
# - From Port to Port (95219): Friz's cask goes to Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas; only players of level 43 or
#   more go on to Feralas from here, and the Feralas guide doesn't hand it in.

step Beast Entrails as you go
  along until argo
  background
  tip Most beasts in the Riverglades drop Beast Entrails for Argo: the shore crawlers on this coast and the boars on the ridge west of the pirates.
  collect 268632 x15 quest 95261.1      -- Beast Entrails

step The pirates' second wave
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip North along the coast from the port: the Eastsea raiders and bombardiers have dug in on the slopes west of the buccaneers' camp, among their powder kegs. They are a couple of levels above you: pull them one at a time. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams these cliffs and the beach below: if you see him, keep well away.
  kill 257915 x8 quest 95122.1          -- Eastsea Raider
  kill 257916 x8 quest 95122.2 @79.1,33.8  -- Eastsea Bombardier
  collect 268346 x5 quest 95123.1       -- Eastsea Powder Keg

step Captain Bentcoin
  tip East along the cliffs to the far end of the pirates' camp: Captain Bentcoin waits by the water, Captain Haynes beside him.
  turnin 95293                          -- Captain Bentcoin
  accept 95294                          -- Captain Haynes: Smuggler's Bargain

step Powderfuse Port
  tip Back to the port.
  turnin 95122                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95123
  accept 95165                          -- See Ya, Scallywags!
  accept 95124                          -- Admiral Lamora
  turnin 95294                          -- Friz Frazzlespark

step The pirates' ships
  tip Out to the pirates' cliffs once more. Plant Whizzbuzz's charges on the three ships moored below the camp, south to north; Admiral Lamora (level 45) stands by the middle one, with her loot chest beside her. Keep an eye out for Gul'gash on the way.
  use 268505 quest 95165.3 @90.9,39.5   -- Remote Explosive Charge, the southern ship
  kill 257861 quest 95124.1             -- Admiral Lamora
  collect 268506 quest 95124.2          -- Lamora's Loot
  use 268505 quest 95165.2 @90.6,29.6   -- the middle ship
  use 268505 quest 95165.1 @88.3,25.8   -- the northern ship

step Rotflesh Mushrooms
  tip West from the northern ship, up the ridge: the Rotflesh Mushrooms grow among the rocks, close to the Twilight ogres' camp. The Mature Paletusks on the ridge give entrails too.
  collect 268664 x8 quest 95261.2       -- Rotflesh Mushroom

step Bolder'ok
  tip North-west to Bolder'ok, the ogres' town. Its ogres side with the Horde and attack you on sight, and Clugfist on his hill in the middle is an elite (level 50): keep to the town's north-eastern edge, where Dunston Willis hides.
  turnin 96125                          -- Dunston Willis
  accept 96126                          -- An Ogre's Captive

step Gronok's Key
  tip Gronok the Butcher (level 44) carries the key: he paces the lanes south of Dunston's hut.
  collect 272190 quest 96126.1          -- Gronok's Key

step Dunston Willis
  tip Free him, then get him out: Dunston fights his way out of Bolder'ok, and you keep the ogres off him. If he falls, take the quest from him again.
  turnin 96126
  accept 94927                          -- Dunston Checks Out
  complete 94927 @68.7,12.6             -- help Dunston break out of Bolder'ok

step Finish the Beast Entrails
  when !has 268632 x15
  tip South-east out of the hills towards the port: the shore crawlers on the beach north of the docks are the quickest entrails. Gul'gash wanders down to this beach too.
  collect 268632 x15 quest 95261.1 @78.7,49.8  -- Beast Entrails

step Powderfuse Port
  label argo
  tip Down to the port.
  turnin 95165                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95124
  turnin 95261                          -- Argo Brinewhistle
  accept 95267 optional                 -- The Monster Surfaces: a big beast in the shallows south-west of the port, near Old Rot-Chum, the elite

step The Monster Surfaces
  when onquest 95267
  tip The Monstrous Threshadon prowls the shallows south-west of the port, below the murlocs' beaches. Old Rot-Chum, an elite, walks the shore close by: give him room.
  collect 268633 quest 95267.1          -- Sea Monster's Head

step Argo Brinewhistle
  when onquest 95267
  turnin 95267

step The meadows
  tip West of the port, the wildflowers grow in the meadows below Sleebo's workshop.
  collect 271823 x20 quest 95975.1      -- Wildflower

step Farholde Keep
  tip South-west across the plains to Farholde Keep. Ashe Amberhall and Demar Brant stand together in the keep at the east end: Ashe first, her news is what Brant's next orders wait on.
  turnin 94881                          -- Ashe Amberhall
  turnin 94879
  accept 94907                          -- A Small Favor: for part 4
  turnin 95059                          -- Demar Brant
  turnin 94877
  turnin 95066
  accept 95329                          -- Out in the Field: for Watcher Cornelius at Terral's Watch (part 4)
  accept 94886                          -- The Western Front: for part 4

step Demar Brant
  when onquest 94885
  turnin 94885
  accept 94887                          -- Saving Marshal Ryan: for part 4

step Ashe Amberhall
  when onquest 94884
  turnin 94884

step Ember Bladewhisper
  when onquest 95912
  turnin 95912

step Brother Lowley
  when onquest 96081
  tip Brother Lowley tends the wounded beside the barracks: bandage three of his soldiers, then he has a note for Sister Rowland in the cathedral.
  collect 4338 x20 anywhere             -- Mageweave Cloth
  turnin 96081
  accept 96082                          -- Doctor's Orderly
  use 272126 quest 96082.1 @65.5,79.3   -- Makeshift Bandages, on the Wounded Soldiers beside him
  turnin 96082
  accept 96083                          -- Clerical Quarantine

step Farholde Keep, the west side
  tip West through the keep: Tessa Dawnbright by the orchard, then the cathedral and Wheatley south of the inn if you have their errands.
  turnin 95975                          -- Tessa Dawnbright

step Sister Rowland
  when onquest 96083
  turnin 96083
  accept 96084                          -- Something's in the Water: for part 4

step Wheatley
  when onquest 95991
  turnin 95991
